    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p10-q15-responses",
        "type": "group",
        "label": "",
        "prompt": "If this is spun five times, find the probability that white is obtained",
        "layout": "grid",
        "columns": 2,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "p10-q15-a",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "a",
            "prompt": "at least once",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\dfrac{1023}{1024}$",
              "worked": "Each spin has probability $\\frac34$ of white and $\\frac14$ of non-white. The spins are independent.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\Pr(\\text{at least one white})&=1-\\Pr(\\text{no white})\\\\\\Pr(\\text{at least one white})&=1-\\left(\\frac14\\right)^5\\\\\\Pr(\\text{at least one white})&=\\frac{1023}{1024}.\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 32
          },
          {
            "id": "p10-q15-b",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "b",
            "prompt": "at least twice",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\dfrac{63}{64}$\n\nSubtract the probabilities of no white and exactly one white from $1$.",
              "worked": "Exactly one white can occur in any of the five spin positions. Each such sequence has probability $\\frac34\\left(\\frac14\\right)^4$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\Pr(\\text{exactly one white})&=5\\times\\frac34\\times\\left(\\frac14\\right)^4\\\\\\Pr(\\text{exactly one white})&=\\frac{15}{1024}.\\end{align*}$$\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\Pr(\\text{at least two whites})&=1-\\Pr(\\text{no white})-\\Pr(\\text{exactly one white})\\\\\\Pr(\\text{at least two whites})&=1-\\frac{1}{1024}-\\frac{15}{1024}\\\\\\Pr(\\text{at least two whites})&=\\frac{63}{64}.\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 48
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
